notes: 'Source-bound NTA trace-element stock of JCM243, referenced by MediaDive ingredient1031 in J1328.
  Generic Trace minerals owner is not globally equivalent.

  Dissolve NTA in200ml water; adjust pH6.5 with KOH. Add remaining salts, adjust volume1L and pH7.0 with
  KOH. Water is final batch volume, not additive1L plus200ml.'
